{
  "info": {
    "name": "ANota API",
    "description": "Rotas do ANota (projeto integrador) - etapa 3.\n\nRodar o schema.sql e o seed.sql antes. Usuario de teste: marcos@anota.com / 123456.\n\nComece pelo Login: ele salva o token na variavel {{token}} e todas as outras rotas ja mandam o header Authorization: Bearer {{token}}.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login e cadastro",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"marcos@anota.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Devolve o token JWT e salva na variavel {{token}}."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// salva o token pra usar nas outras rotas",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login senha errada (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"marcos@anota.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"errada\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cadastro",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cadastro"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Pedro Alves\",\n  \"cnpj\": \"11.222.333/0001-81\",\n  \"email\": \"pedro@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Cria a conta e ja devolve o token (aqui nao salva, pra continuar testando com o Marcos). Rodar 2 vezes da erro de email repetido."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastro CNPJ invalido (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cadastro",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cadastro"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Pedro Alves\",\n  \"cnpj\": \"11.111.111/1111-11\",\n  \"email\": \"pedro2@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastro email repetido (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
